#
# Forage, node bounties: layer 84 of the matrix. It finds and claims work
# for this node and posts the node's own bounties, over methods zxvd
# already has: what the node wants, shares and still waits on (net.offers),
# a claim sent as a sell to the bounty's poster and a bounty posted as a
# want (net.command), the peer book's wallet and whether the node serves
# (peer.status), answering other nodes for a price (peer.serve), the
# swarm's tokens a cycle, the bounties returned and the owner's quest
# (swarm.state), and the node's power draw and posture (power.status).
# Every method is zxvd's; none is invented. zxvd has no bounty board, so a
# bounty another node posts is entered on Forage's board by the owner
# (forage_model.h FG2); the missing board is in the build report.
#
# Advisory and owner-confirmed (forage_model.h FG4, FG5): a claim or a
# posted bounty is only checked and held, with a notice, until the owner
# approves it (owner_confirmed); only then is net.command sent, and a
# cancelled one sends nothing. peer.serve stays off: Forage never calls it
# unless the owner turns serving on (forage_serve, owner_confirmed), and
# turning it off takes the owner's word too. Forage never sends a network
# mode ("off", "lan", "online", "peer"). Money is integer minor units of
# VFV, never a float.
#
# The fee and the net (FR1). zxvd charges the 0.08889% assurance fee to
# the buyer, on top of the price (fairground.assurance_fee), and the
# seller is paid the price. A bounty's value is the gross its poster
# offers, so Forage claims it at its net, value - fee(value): the poster
# then pays net + fee(net), which never passes the value. A bounty this
# node posts is sent as a want at the net of its value, for the same
# reason. The net is witnessed in Sutra and Trebago (as Fairground's fee
# is); past Sutra's 9(15) it is held.
#
# Composed, not written again: the fee is fairground.assurance_fee (layer
# 79, built before this one) and the wallet after a claim is paid
# coffer.balance (layer 73). Of the other layers the task names, Ramble
# (25) owns a payment consent covering a spend, and Forage spends nothing
# without the owner's approval of each claim, so no consent is read;
# Murmuration (61) only re-exports swarm_shares, whose limits are a swarm
# agent's slice of a cycle, not a node's budget for outside work, so
# neither is used. Hamlet (96) is built after this one and nothing of it
# is used.
#
# Witness pairs are of one kind (zxapp.c run_one B3). Eve and Sutra witness
# claim_fits, a truth: Eve checks each field against its own range alone,
# so the budgets come as margins (tokroom, mwroom) the model works out from
# swarm.state, power.status and the owner's budgets. Trebago alone ranks
# bounties by value per minute, exact by cross products, and MYRA files a
# bounty's record. The model's C (forage_rules.h) is the third witness.
#
# Tidewatch (15) and Bramble (48) lean on this layer, so the net after the
# fee, a claim inside the node's budgets, the rank by value per minute and
# a bounty's record are general and owned here (CONCEPTS.tsv).
#
# Planned (no runtime yet): Prolog (rules, searching for every answer that
# fits), Eiffel (design by contract) and Solidity (contract rules) own
# whether a claim may stand inside the node's budgets: pending on
# claim_fits.
#
# Defaults taken: the owner's budgets start at 0, so no claim fits until
# the owner sets them (forage_set_budget). The swarm's budget for bounties
# is the owner's, held to the cycle's tokens scaled by the power posture
# (swarm.state tokens_per_cycle times power.status token_scale_permille,
# per mille, floored). power.status is read under sys.read, as Retort
# declares it, so sys.read is needed beside the task's peers, net, swarm
# and notify. zxvd has no notification method, so the notice is only
# composed for the view (forage_t notice).
zxapp 1
id     forage
name   Forage
version 1.0.0
slot   84
layer  L1
matrix 84
icon   icons/l1/084-forage.svg
budget 233
needs  peers
needs  net
needs  swarm
needs  notify
needs  sys.read
model  apps/forage_model.c
use    fairground 1   # @num.fairground_assurance_fee
use    coffer 1       # @num.coffer_balance

# A bounty's value net of the 0.08889% fee (FR1): amount - floor(amount *
# 8889 / 10^7). Sutra holds 15 digits and refuses past them; Trebago
# answers to 2^53 - 1.
provides net_after_fee num amount
logic    sutra   net_after_fee apps/blocks/forage/net.sutra
logic    trebago net_after_fee apps/blocks/forage/net.tb

# A claim inside the node's swarm and power budgets (FR2): tokens at least
# 1, a draw not below 0, both margins not below 0. Eve holds 9 digits as
# no; Sutra refuses them.
provides claim_fits truth tokens mw tokroom mwroom
logic    eve   claim_fits apps/blocks/forage/claim.eve
logic    sutra claim_fits apps/blocks/forage/claim.sutra
pending  Prolog claim_fits
pending  Eiffel claim_fits
pending  Solidity claim_fits

# Bounties ranked by value per minute (FR3), exact, in Trebago.
provides rate_rank num amount minutes
logic    trebago rate_rank apps/blocks/forage/rank.tb

# A bounty's record on the node's board (FR4), in MYRA.
provides bounty_rec_ok truth bounty kind tokens mw amount minutes status
logic    myra bounty_rec_ok apps/blocks/forage/bounty.myra

# Its own proof (zxapp.h K1): each entry at its edges, and where its languages disagree
check net_after_fee amount=0,1124,1125,180000,10000000,999999999999999 = 0,1124,1124,179840,9991111,999111100000000
check net_after_fee amount=1,1000000000000000 = both
check net_after_fee amount=1,9007199254740991 = both
check claim_fits tokens=1,999999999,0,5,5,5,5 mw=0,999999999,0,0,-1,0,0 tokroom=0,999999999,0,0,0,-1,0 mwroom=0,999999999,0,0,0,0,-1 = true,true,false,true,false,false,false
check claim_fits tokens=1,1000000000 mw=0,0 tokroom=0,0 mwroom=0,0 = both
check claim_fits tokens=1,1 mw=0,0 tokroom=0,0 mwroom=0,1000000000 = both
check rate_rank amount=600,300,900,0,300 minutes=10,5,30,1,10 = 1,1,3,5,3
check rate_rank amount=999999999,1,0 minutes=1,999999999,999999999 = 1,2,3
check bounty_rec_ok bounty=9999,10000,1,1,1,1 kind=1,1,10,1,1,1 tokens=999999999,1,1,1000000000,1,1 mw=0,0,0,0,0,0 amount=999999999999999,0,0,0,1000000000000000,0 minutes=1,1,1,1,1,1000000000 status=3,0,0,0,0,0 = true,false,false,false,false,false
# A claim of 20000 VFV gross: its fee, and the wallet after it is paid at its net
check fairground.assurance_fee amount=20000,0 = 17,0
check coffer.balance before=29983,0 moved=19983,0 = 49966,0
